- `WuyingWorkstationTeam`: Linggou Team Edition Container Workstation.
- `WuyingWorkstationBusiness`: Linggou Dedicated Edition Container Workstation.
- `AndroidCloud`: Cloud Phone.
- `AIAgent`: AgentBay (AI agent).', example='CloudApp', position='Body'),
  startTime: string(name='StartTime', description='The start time of the query. **Required**. Use the ISO 8601 format: `yyyy-MM-dd\\\\"T\\\\"HH:mm:ss`. You can include three-digit milliseconds and use `Z` or `±HH:mm` to specify the time zone. We recommend that you always include the time zone offset. The query includes this time, and the start time must be earlier than or equal to the `EndTime`. The service only retains and retrieves events that occurred within 30 days before the call time.

