Calculation formula: TradePrice = OriginalPrice - DiscountPrice. For the currency, see Currency. This operation returns only a quote and does not execute payment.', example='10.00'),
    }(name='Price', description='The price details of the scale-out. For the currency, see Currency. For the coupon selection status, see Promotions.'),
