  nodeCapacity?: int32(name='NodeCapacity', description='The number of concurrent sessions, which is the number of sessions that can be simultaneously connected to a single resource. If too many sessions are connected simultaneously, the application experience may degrade. The value range varies depending on the resource specification. The value ranges for each resource specification are as follows:

